#: props.py:162
msgid "Gap left between the pin and the wall of its socket, on each side (mm) - so the socket comes out twice this much wider than the pin. It is what makes a printed connector go home firmly instead of rattling or refusing to enter. Set by the Fit preset unless that is Custom"
msgstr "销与其插槽壁之间在每侧留出的间隙（毫米）——因此插槽会比销宽出两倍该值。它决定了打印出的连接件能否牢固到位，而不是晃动或插不进去。由配合预设设置，除非预设为自定义"

